OL,3,GNEWSAForce uses AI to cut wait times on
OL,4,A101 calls
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Yorkshire Police has launched a
OL,7,Fcall handling system using AI software
OL,8,Fto triage calls to its non-emergency
OL,9,F101 number.
OL,11,FIt is hoped the new service will cut
OL,12,Fwaiting times for people trying to
OL,13,Freport crimes by weeding out
OL,14,Fmisdirected, nuisance and prank calls.
OL,16,FThe force received more than 470,000
OL,17,Fcalls to its 101 number over the year
OL,18,Fto June 2026, with wait times between
OL,19,Feight and 15 seconds, according to
OL,20,Fofficial figures.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
