OL,3,GNEWSAForce uses AI to cut wait times on
OL,4,A101 calls
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe system uses an AI model to match
OL,7,Fwhy someone is calling 101 to a set of
OL,8,Flikely reasons. It then redirects
OL,9,Fnon-police issues to the correct agency
OL,10,Fbefore the caller enters a queue.
